body:
In the original version, many operations were not reversible or modifiable. Therefore, this mod has added some right-click interaction methods and some recipes.

### Example 

- Recycled and reformed glowstone from the respawn anchor;
- The Ender eye of the end portal frame for recycling; 
- Added a formula for decomposing glowstone into glowstone dust; 
- Right-click to replace/upgrade the furnace; 
- Repair the anvil with iron ingots.

Some of the content has been transferred to the [Wealizh](https://modrinth.com/mod/wealizh) module
